  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Toward Sustainable Development in Aquaculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development objective: Contributing to the aquaculture&apos;s sustainable development, promoting: the strengthening of the aquaculture productive chain, with its diversity and ordainment to increase production and promote social inclusion, thus increasing income and job offer to low-income populations and other relevant actors in the sector. br  Immediate Objective 1: Improve the performance of the aquaculture productive chains.  br  Immediate Objective 2:  Set sustainability criteria to the aquaculture parks  br 
Immediate Objective 3: Control quality in the production of water animals and aquaculture products  br 
Immediate Objective 4: Structure monitoring and analysis tools to the National Plan on Aquaculture Monitoring ? PNMA.   br  Immediate Objective 5: Restructure the legal framework of the Brazilian aquaculture legislation.  br  Immediate Objective 6: Expand the institutional sustainability of the sector through studies, planning and execution of management actions.</narrative>
  </description>
